(4201967, 'nyt', 'From Chinese Patriot to American Spy: The Unusual Life of John Leung', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/asia/china-spy-john-leung.html', 'He had been hailed by Chinese state media as a model for his efforts to promote Beijing’s interests in the United States. He was in fact an F.B.I. informant.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 10:01:53 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 12:07:40'),
