(4202457, 'rt', 'Олимпийский чемпион по велоспорту Эвенепул попал в больницу после столкновения с фургоном', 'https://russian.rt.com/sport/news/1404505-evenepul-bolnica-velosport?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Олимпийский чемпион по велоспорту Ремко Эвенепул попал в больницу после аварии, в которую попал во время тренировки. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:28:22 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:11'),
(4202458, 'rt', 'Путин заявил, что желающие стратегического поражения России хотят её уничтожения', 'https://russian.rt.com/ussr/news/1404499-putin-strategicheskoe-porazhenie-rossiya?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Российский президент Владимир Путин в ходе общения с проходящими реабилитацию бойцами СВО заявил, что желающие стратегического поражения России хотят её уничтожения. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:22:09 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:12'),
(4202459, 'rt', 'Как остудить пыл грузинской президентши', 'https://russian.rt.com/opinion/1404314-mirzayan-gruziya-maidan-zurabishvili?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n «Мадам президент прекрасно видит, что нынешняя попытка «майдана» в Грузии постепенно выдыхается. В правительстве не нашлось своего Януковича, никто на компромиссы с «майдаунами» не идёт — и сейчас единственным способом поддержать угасающий костёр будет вливание в него крови». Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:21:12 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:14'),
(4202460, 'rt', 'В Тбилиси протестующие вновь вышли к зданию парламента', 'https://russian.rt.com/ussr/news/1404501-tbilisi-protestuyuschie-parlament?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n В Тбилиси у здания парламента вновь собралась толпа. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:20:45 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:16'),
(4202461, 'rt', 'Со всеми ладил и ничего не боялся: умер подаренный Путиным японскому губернатору кот по кличке Мир', 'https://russian.rt.com/nopolitics/article/1404451-kot-mir-smert-yaponiya?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Сибирский кот по кличке Мир, которого Владимир Путин в 2012 году подарил губернатору японской префектуры Акита Норихисе Сатакэ, умер в возрасте 12 лет из-за болезни, пишет Kyodo. Губернатор намерен провести внеочередную пресс-конференцию по этому поводу 9 декабря. Мир стал подарком чиновнику от российского лидера в ответ на щенка акита-ину Юмэ. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:20:30 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:18'),
(4202462, 'rt', '«Сирийские и российские боевые самолёты нанесли совместные удары»: как развивается ситуация в Сирии', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/article/1404474-siriya-sovmestnye-udary-boeviki?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n По отрядам боевиков на юге провинции Идлиб и на севере провинции Хама нанесён удар сирийскими и российскими самолётами, заявили в Минобороны Сирии. Отмечается, что среди террористов десятки убитых и раненых, также уничтожена техника. По данным СМИ, подразделения ВС Сирии укрепляют оборону на северном рубеже провинции Хама в рамках подготовки к контратаке против террористических формирований. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:19:23 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:20'),
(4202463, 'rt', 'Кравец и Тамбиев войдут в тренерский штаб сборной легионеров КХЛ на Кубке Первого канала', 'https://russian.rt.com/sport/news/1404502-kravec-tambiev-legionery-kubok-hokkei?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Главный тренер «Куньлуня» Михаил Кравец и возглавляющий «Адмирал» Леонид Тамбиев войдут в тренерский штаб сборной легионеров КХЛ на Кубке Первого канала. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:19:09 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:22'),
(4202464, 'rt', 'Парламент Южной Кореи проголосовал за отмену военного положения', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1404500-parlament-yuzhnaya-koreya-voennoe-polozhenie?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Парламент Южной Кореи принял резолюцию, призывающую к отмене в республике военного положения. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:15:47 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:23'),
(4202465, 'rt', 'Эксперт Воронцов объяснил, почему в Южной Корее ввели военное положение', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1404497-ekspert-voroncov-yuzhnoi-koree?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Завотделом Кореи и Монголии Института востоковедения РАН Александр Воронцов в беседе с RT объяснил, почему в Южной Корее ввели военное положение. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:14:06 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:25'),
(4202466, 'rt', 'Военные проникли в здание парламента Южной Кореи', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1404498-voennye-parlament-yuzhnaya-koreya?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Войска, обеспечивающие военное положение в Южной Корее, проникли в здание Национального собрания республики. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:08:49 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:27'),
(4202467, 'rt', 'Моуринью недоволен отношением турецких СМИ к нему', 'https://russian.rt.com/sport/news/1404496-mourinyu-tureckie-smi?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Главный тренер «Фенербахче» Жозе Моуринью раскритиковал турецкие СМИ за отношение к нему. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:03:13 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:29'),
(4202468, 'rt', 'В ФРГ отметили снижение делового климата в автопроме', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1404493-frg-otmetili-snizhenie?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Индекс делового климата в немецкой автопромышленности в прошлом месяце снизился почти на 4 пункта, до -32. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 19:00:52 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:30'),
(4202469, 'rt', 'Суд оштрафовал Telegram на 4 млн рублей за отказ удалить запрещённый контент', 'https://russian.rt.com/russia/news/1404495-sud-shtraf-telegram?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Таганский суд Москвы оштрафовал мессенджер Telegram на 4 млн рублей за отказ удалить запрещённый контент, сообщает РИА Новости. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 18:59:38 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:32'),
(4202470, 'rt', 'Между военнослужащими и протестующими в Сеуле произошли столкновения', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1404489-voennye-protestuyuschie-stolknoveniya?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Между южнокорейскими военнослужащими и протестующими возле входа в здание парламента в Сеуле произошли столкновения. Читать далее\n', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 18:53:37 +0300', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:34'),
(4202471, 'wallsj', 'Cease-Fire Between Israel, Hezbollah Teeters as Sides Exchange Fire', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/cease-fire-between-israel-hezbollah-teeters-as-sides-exchange-fire-dd0a05dc', 'The flare-up in fighting highlights the ambiguities within the deal over how the cease-fire should be enforced.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 12:13:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:36'),
(4202472, 'wallsj', 'South Korea Votes to End Martial Law, Hours After President Declared Move', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/south-koreas-president-declares-martial-law-citing-threat-of-pro-north-korean-forces-a1fdc738', 'Yoon Suk Yeol, the country’s leader, had said the nation was being held hostage by opposition parties he accused of antistate activities.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 11:55:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:01:38'),
(4202473, 'wstreet', 'Gold Futures Rise as U.S. Economic Data Points to Cooling Economy', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/gold-rises-ahead-of-key-u-s-economic-data-29d6c4ab?mod=rss_markets_main', 'Gold futures rose as the market digested the latest U.S. economic data and its consequences for interest-rate cuts.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 12:28:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:09'),
(4202474, 'wstreet', 'U.S. Stocks Mixed as Investors Raise Bets on December Rate Cut', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/australia-shares-set-to-build-on-latest-record-086ceb96?mod=rss_markets_main', 'U.S. stocks are mixed as traders increased their bets on an interest-rate cut this month. Meanwhile, New York-listed South Korean securities fell, and the won tumbled, after South Korea’s president declared martial law.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 12:18:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:11');
INSERT INTO `mynews` (`id`, `agency`, `head`, `link`, `text`, `pubdate`, `garbage`, `time_new`) VALUES
(4202475, 'wstreet', 'Dollar Recovers on U.S. Labor Data', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/most-asian-currencies-weaken-in-likely-spillover-effect-from-yuan-2ebb00b2?mod=rss_markets_main', 'WSJ Dollar Index was stable after declining before the JOLTS report, which showed 7.7 million job openings on the last business day of October, little changed from September.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 11:32:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:13'),
(4202476, 'wstreet', 'How Parents Can Help Their Boomerang Child---Without Derailing Their Own Retirement', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/parenting-retirement-boomerang-children-368eec0b?mod=rss_markets_main', 'Set boundaries and encourage responsibility for your kids, and consider making catch-up contributions in your 401(k)s and IRAs.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 11:00:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:15'),
(4202477, 'wstreet', 'Milder Weather Outlook Keeps Pressure on U.S. Natural Gas', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/milder-weather-outlook-keeps-pressure-on-u-s-natural-gas-d7389d99?mod=rss_markets_main', 'U.S. natural gas futures fell as the market looks beyond this week’s subfreezing weather to milder forecasts that could slow the shrinkage in storage levels.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 10:35:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:16'),
(4202478, 'wstreet', 'Buy Now, Pay Later Has Almost a Billion Reasons To Celebrate the Season', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/buy-now-pay-later-has-almost-a-billion-reasons-to-celebrate-the-season-99bb6169?mod=rss_markets_main', 'Cyber Monday spending via buy now, pay later hit a record in the U.S., which could further fuel investor hype for these digital payments.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 10:01:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:18'),
(4202479, 'nyt', 'Live Updates: South Korean Lawmakers Vote to Defy President, Demanding an End to Martial Law', 'https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/12/03/world/south-korea-martial-law', 'President Yoon Suk Yeol announced the extraordinary move amid a bitter fight with the political opposition, and protesters clashed with police outside the assembly.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:59:44 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:47'),
(4202480, 'nyt', 'Amid Syria’s Rebel Offensive, a Geopolitical Cauldron Simmers', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/middleeast/syria-rebel-offensive-iran-russia.html', 'Iran and Russia, both stretched by conflicts of their own, have experienced setbacks in Syria after a rebel offensive in the northwest of the country.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:16:05 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:48'),
(4202481, 'nyt', 'Why Israel and Hezbollah Are Still Firing Amid a Lebanon Cease-Fire', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/middleeast/israel-hezbollah-cease-fire-violations.html', 'Some violations of the truce, and some amount of violence, are to be expected, analysts say, and do not necessarily mean the deal will collapse and war will resume anytime soon.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 16:08:59 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:50'),
(4202482, 'nyt', 'Syria Fighting Worsens Already Dire Conditions in Idlib and Aleppo', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/middleeast/syria-civil-war-rebels-aleppo.html', 'Years of war and a powerful earthquake had led to crushing poverty, displacement and breakdowns in services. But over the last several days, the region’s misery deepened.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:12:42 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:52'),
(4202483, 'nyt', 'Israeli Officials Welcome Trump’s Demand to Free Hostages Before Inauguration', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/middleeast/israel-trump-hostages.html', 'The Israeli leader’s comments came after President-elect Donald J. Trump threatened to take unspecified action unless the hostages held in Gaza are released by Jan. 20.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 16:14:50 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:02:58'),
(4202484, 'nyt', 'China Announces a Ban on Rare Minerals to the U.S.', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/asia/china-minerals-semiconductors.html', 'The move escalates supply chain warfare and comes a day after the Biden administration expanded curbs on the sale of advanced American technology to China.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 16:20:09 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:00'),
(4202485, 'nyt', 'Airbnb ‘Gladiator’ Experience at the Colosseum Prompts Outcry in Rome', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/europe/airbnb-gladiator-colosseum-rome.html', 'An initiative by officials at the monument in a partnership with Airbnb has prompted an outcry among those who feel it will demean a cultural treasure.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 16:26:47 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:01'),
(4202486, 'nyt', 'Who Is Yoon Suk-Yeol, South Korea’s President?', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/asia/yoon-suk-yeol-south-korea-president.html', 'A conservative, Mr. Yoon won the presidency in 2022 by a slim margin, promising a more confrontational stance against North Korea. He quickly became unpopular and divisive at home.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:58:01 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:10'),
(4202487, 'nyt', 'Martial Law Declared in South Korea: What to Know', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/asia/what-is-martial-law-south-korea.html', 'President Yoon Suk Yeol has been locked in a bitter fight with the opposition, which controls Parliament', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:10:24 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:12'),
(4202488, 'nyt', 'Chaos Plays Out at South Korea’s Legislature Building After Declaration of Martial Law', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/asia/south-korea-legislature-chaos.html', 'Soldiers wearing helmets and carrying long guns pushed back against people who tried to enter the National Assembly, after President Yoon Suk Yeol declared martial law.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:22:15 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:14'),
(4202489, 'nyt', 'Read President Yoon’s Speech Declaring Martial Law in South Korea', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/03/world/asia/president-yoon-speech-martial-law.html', 'President Yoon Suk Yeol made the extraordinary declaration in an unannounced speech to the nation on Tuesday night.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 15:23:03 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:15'),
(4202490, 'nyt', 'Who Are the Syrian Rebels Who Seized Aleppo?', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/02/world/middleeast/syria-rebels-hts-who-what.html', 'The group now advancing, Hayat Tahrir al-Sham, says it wants to replace the Assad government with one inspired by Islamic principles.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 09:38:24 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:33'),
(4202491, 'nyt', 'The Secret Pentagon War Game That ​Offers a Stark​ Warning for Our Times', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/02/magazine/nuclear-strategy-proud-prophet.html', 'The devastating outcome of the 1983 game reveals that nuclear escalation inevitably spirals out of control.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 16:54:20 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:03:51'),
(4202492, 'jazeera', 'Is the battle for Aleppo part of Syria’s war?', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/3/is-the-battle-for-aleppo-part-of-syrias-war?traffic_source=rss', 'Opposition forces stormed into regime-held areas, shaking the status quo and bringing the war back into the spotlight.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:26:40 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:29'),
(4202493, 'jazeera', 'US imposes new sanctions on Iran’s ‘shadow fleet’ of oil tankers', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/3/us-imposes-new-sanctions-on-irans-shadow-fleet-of-oil-tankers?traffic_source=rss', 'The latest US sanctions are part of an effort to disrupt Iran&#039;s use of oil revenue to finance its nuclear programme. ', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 17:09:02 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:31'),
(4202494, 'jazeera', 'UN raises alarm over Syria as opposition groups press Hama offensive', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/3/un-sounds-alarm-on-civilian-deaths-battered-health-system-in-syria-attacks?traffic_source=rss', 'Syrian state media says government troops are in fierce battles with opposition groups in Hama province.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 16:59:27 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:32'),
(4202495, 'jazeera', 'Where was the Lebanese government as Israel waged war?', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/program/newsfeed/2024/12/3/where-was-the-lebanese-government-as-israel-waged-war?traffic_source=rss', 'As Israel relentlessly bombed Lebanon, the country’s military largely stayed out of the war. ', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 15:49:54 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:34'),
(4202496, 'jazeera', 'Crime against humanity: Why has a court found Belgium guilty of kidnapping?', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/3/crime-against-humanity-why-has-a-court-found-belgium-guilty-of-kidnapping?traffic_source=rss', 'Thousands of children were forcibly taken from their families in Belgian colonies because they were mixed-race.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 15:26:47 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:36'),
(4202497, 'jazeera', 'This year, Arab-American political power came to the fore', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/opinions/2024/12/3/this-year-arab-american-political-power-came-to-the?traffic_source=rss', 'Arab Americans no longer ‘accept crumbs’, they want their ‘share of the pie’ in US politics.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 15:03:10 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:38'),
(4202498, 'jazeera', 'Muqeem takes five wickets as Pakistan defeat Zimbabwe to win T20 series', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2024/12/3/muqeem-takes-five-wickets-as-pakistan-defeat-zimbabwe-to-win-t20-series?traffic_source=rss', 'Pakistan wins by 10 wickets to take a 2-0 lead with one match to play in the three-game series.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 14:59:47 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:40'),
(4202499, 'jazeera', 'Georgia protests: What’s behind them and what’s next?', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/3/georgia-protests-whats-behind-them-and-whats-next?traffic_source=rss', 'Demonstrations broke out after PM Irakli Kobakhidze postponed EU membership talks until 2028.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 14:52:50 +0000', 0, '2024-12-03 18:04:42'),
