(4202707, 'wstreet', 'Investors Raise Bets on December Rate Cut', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/australia-shares-set-to-build-on-latest-record-086ceb96?mod=rss_markets_main', 'U.S. stocks swung between small gains and losses as traders increased their bets on an interest-rate cut this month. The Nasdaq Composite was poised to hit a new record.', 'Tue, 03 Dec 2024 15:28:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-03 21:02:10'),
