(4203782, 'mehr', 'FMs of Astana Process guarantors to meet in Doha soon', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225242/FMs-of-Astana-Process-guarantors-to-meet-in-Doha-soon', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Iran’s Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi says that he is to meet with his counterparts from Astana Process countries—Turkiye and Russia—in Doha in the coming days.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 12:18:21 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:41'),
(4203783, 'mehr', 'Russia captures two more strategic settlements in Donetsk', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225238/Russia-captures-two-more-strategic-settlements-in-Donetsk', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Russian forces have captured the settlements of Ilyinka and Petrovka in Donetsk, the Russian Defense Ministry said on Sunday.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 12:10:34 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:43'),
(4203784, 'mehr', 'Iran, China stress expanding bilateral cooperation', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225230/Iran-China-stress-expanding-bilateral-cooperation', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Iran’s Vice President and Chinese Vice Premier held a meeting within the framework of implementing parts of the comprehensive strategic plan between the two countries, stressing the development of cooperation.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 11:23:05 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:45'),
(4203785, 'mehr', 'Over 60% of buildings in Metula damaged by Hezbollah', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225236/Over-60-of-buildings-in-Metula-damaged-by-Hezbollah', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – More than 60% of buildings in Metula were struck and damaged by Hezbollah\'s rockets, Israeli media have reported.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 10:38:22 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:47'),
(4203786, 'mehr', 'Iran table tennis team win bronze at Asia-Pacific Deaf Games', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225232/Iran-table-tennis-team-win-bronze-at-Asia-Pacific-Deaf-Games', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – The Iranian table tennis team won the bronze medal at the 10th Asia-Pacific Deaf Games held in Malaysia.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 10:16:57 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:48'),
(4203787, 'mehr', 'Pyongyang right to worry about its security', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225234/Pyongyang-right-to-worry-about-its-security', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Events in South Korea have shown that the country is unpredictable from the point of view of stability, North Korea is right to be concerned about its security, Russian Foreign Ministry Spokeswoman Maria Zakharova said.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 10:15:34 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:50'),
(4203788, 'mehr', 'Iran lifts curbs on visits to Abu Musa Island', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225233/Iran-lifts-curbs-on-visits-to-Abu-Musa-Island', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – The governor of Abu Musa Island has announced that the government has decided to lift restrictions on visits to the island and to increase the number of flights as well.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 09:55:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:52'),
(4203789, 'mehr', 'S. Korean defense chief offers resignation', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225235/S-Korean-defense-chief-offers-resignation', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – South Korea\'s defense minister submitted resignation to President Yoon Suk-yeol on Wednesday.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 09:45:02 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:54'),
(4203790, 'mehr', 'Iran, UNICEF ink cooperation document on refugees challenges', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225227/Iran-UNICEF-ink-cooperation-document-on-refugees-challenges', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – The Ministry of Interior of the Islamic Republic of Iran and the United Nations International Children\'s Emergency Fund (UNICEF) have signed a cooperation agreement to address the challenges faced by foreign refugees in Iran.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 09:32:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:56'),
(4203791, 'mehr', 'Iran warns of NTP withdrawal if snapback activated: Dep. FM', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225229/Iran-warns-of-NTP-withdrawal-if-snapback-activated-Dep-FM', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Iran’s deputy foreign minister has warned that Iran will walk out of the Treaty on the Non-Proliferation of Nuclear Weapons should the so-called snapback mechanism that fully reinstates anti-Tehran sanctions be activated.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 09:26:15 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:34:58'),
(4203792, 'mehr', 'Iran’s non-oil exports to Iraq increase by 36% in 7 months', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225225/Iran-s-non-oil-exports-to-Iraq-increase-by-36-in-7-months', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Iran’s non-oil exports to Iraq have risen by 36 percent in the first seven months of the current Iranian year (March 20–October 21), reaching $7.288 billion, according to the Trade Promotion Organization (TPO) of Iran.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 08:57:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:00'),
(4203793, 'mehr', 'South Korean lawmakers call for President Yoon’s resignation', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225226/South-Korean-lawmakers-call-for-President-Yoon-s-resignation', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Protests continue to sweep Seoul as South Koreans call for president Yoon Suk Yeol’s resignation following his declaration and subsequent lifting of martial law in the country.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 08:35:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:02'),
(4203794, 'mehr', 'At Least 400 militants eliminated during attack on Syria', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225231/At-Least-400-militants-eliminated-during-attack-on-Syria', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Deputy head of the Russian Center for Reconciliation of the Opposing Sides in Syria said at least 400 militants have been eliminated.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 08:31:21 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:04'),
(4203795, 'mehr', 'Iran’s Foreign Minister to visit Baghdad on Friday', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225228/Iran-s-Foreign-Minister-to-visit-Baghdad-on-Friday', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Iran’s Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi is scheduled to visit Baghdad on Friday to discuss regional issues including tensions in Syria.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 08:08:07 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:06'),
(4203796, 'mehr', 'Israel violates ceasefire deal, attacks Lebanon again', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225220/Israel-violates-ceasefire-deal-attacks-Lebanon-again', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – The Israeli regime continues its violations of the fragile ceasefire deal with Lebanon, carrying out more acts of aggression against the country.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 07:57:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:07'),
(4203797, 'mehr', 'UNGA adopts resolution to hold Palestine peace conference', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225222/UNGA-adopts-resolution-to-hold-Palestine-peace-conference', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) –The UN General Assembly has adopted a resolution calling to organize a high-level conference to implement relevant resolutions and the peaceful settlement of the Palestinian issue.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 07:40:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:09'),
(4203798, 'mehr', 'Iranian women makes history at Asia-Pacific Deaf Games', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225224/Iranian-women-makes-history-at-Asia-Pacific-Deaf-Games', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Iranian female runner Zahra Chehrealam made history by winning a bronze medal at the 10th Asia-Pacific Deaf Games held in Malaysia.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 07:25:54 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:11'),
(4203799, 'mehr', 'Arab League to hold emergency meeting on Syria on December 8', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225217/Arab-League-to-hold-emergency-meeting-on-Syria-on-December-8', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) –The Arab League Council will convene for an emergency meeting on Syria on December 8.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 06:56:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:13'),
(4203800, 'mehr', 'Tehran to host 26th GECF ministerial meeting on Nov 6', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225223/Tehran-to-host-26th-GECF-ministerial-meeting-on-Nov-6', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – The Iranian capital will host the 26th ministerial meeting of the Gas Exporting Countries Forum (GECF) on November 6-8, according to a senior official of the Iranian Oil Ministry.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 06:30:09 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:14'),
(4203801, 'mehr', 'VIDEO: Russia conducts hypersonic missile drills', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225219/VIDEO-Russia-conducts-hypersonic-missile-drills', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Russian warships and fighter jets have launched hypersonic, cruise, and ballistic missiles as part of a training exercise in the eastern Mediterranean.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 06:25:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:16'),
(4203802, 'mehr', 'US seeks to preserve its occupation of northeast Syria', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225218/US-seeks-to-preserve-its-occupation-of-northeast-Syria', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Washington has been trying to preserve its de-facto occupation of Syria’s northeastern regions by all means, Russian Permanent Representative to the United Nations Vasily Nebenzya said.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 05:59:11 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:18'),
(4203803, 'mehr', 'Russia sees no grounds for talks with Ukraine: Kremlin', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225221/Russia-sees-no-grounds-for-talks-with-Ukraine-Kremlin', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Russia currently sees \"no grounds for negotiations\" with Ukraine, Kremlin spokesperson Dmitry Peskov said Wednesday.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 05:54:14 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:20'),
(4203804, 'mehr', 'Japan downs Iran at 2024 Asian Women\'s Handball Championship', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225216/Japan-downs-Iran-at-2024-Asian-Women-s-Handball-Championship', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 04 (MNA) – Iran lost to Japan 34-14 at the 20th Asian Women\'s Handball Championship in the opening match on Tuesday.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 05:52:38 GMT', 0, '2024-12-04 13:35:22'),
