(4204426, 'nyt', 'Israel’s Military Says Hostages Were Likely Killed by Hamas as Airstrike Hit', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/04/world/middleeast/israel-gaza-hamas-hostages.html', 'The six hostages, whose bodies were found in Gaza over the summer, were probably shot in February by their captors as an Israeli strike hit close to the tunnel where they were held, the military said.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 20:12:03 +0000', 0, '2024-12-05 00:07:08'),
(4204427, 'nyt', 'Georgia Tumbles Deeper Into Crisis as Government Detains Opposition Figures', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/04/world/europe/georgia-russia-protests-gvaramia.html', 'In a sign of a widening crackdown, security agents have searched the offices and homes of prominent activists and opposition leaders who are furious about the government’s position on Europe.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 21:09:20 +0000', 0, '2024-12-05 00:07:10'),
(4204428, 'nyt', 'Why President Yoon Made a Fateful Decision by Declaring Martial Law', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/04/world/asia/south-korea-yoon-martial-law.html', '​A day after he declared — and then withdrew — martial law, President Yoon Suk Yeol was politically isolated as observers pondered his future in leadership.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 21:57:25 +0000', 0, '2024-12-05 00:07:12'),
(4204429, 'nyt', 'Rohit Bal, Exuberant Star of Indian Fashion, Dies at 63', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/04/style/rohit-bal-dead.html', 'Known as “the bad boy of fashion,” he was among a wave of designers who created modern Indian couture by updating traditional garments.', 'Wed, 04 Dec 2024 23:56:28 +0000', 0, '2024-12-05 00:07:17'),
