(4205153, 'mehr', 'French gov. toppled in no-confidence vote at parliament', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225261/French-gov-toppled-in-no-confidence-vote-at-parliament', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – The French government has been toppled in a vote of no confidence Wednesday, plunging the euro zone’s second-largest economy into a period of deep political uncertainty.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 10:31:57 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:17'),
(4205154, 'mehr', 'Dep. director of Info. Center of President\'s Office tours MNA', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/photo/225259/Dep-director-of-Info-Center-of-President-s-Office-tours-MNA', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – Deputy Director of Communication and Information Center of the President’s Office Deputy of President Office Seyyed Mohammad Mehdi Tabatabaei visited Mehr News Agency (MNA) Headquarters in Tehran on Wednesday.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 10:14:25 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:19'),
(4205155, 'mehr', 'NATO SG should feel responsible for growing global insecurity', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225258/NATO-SG-should-feel-responsible-for-growing-global-insecurity', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) –Iran has criticized the new secretary general of the North Atlantic Treaty Organization (NATO) for “weirdly” setting the agenda for the next US administration, saying he should feel responsible for increasing global insecurity.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 10:04:08 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:21'),
(4205156, 'mehr', 'VIDEO: Biden caught napping!', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225257/VIDEO-Biden-caught-napping', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – Cameras caught a surprising moment as US President Joe Biden seemingly dozed off during a meeting with African leaders in Angola.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 08:46:33 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:23'),
(4205157, 'mehr', 'Funeral ceremony of 100 Unknown Martyrs in Tehran', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/photo/225256/Funeral-ceremony-of-100-Unknown-Martyrs-in-Tehran', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – The funeral ceremony of 100 anonymous martyrs during the eight years of Sacred Defense (Iraqi imposed war against Iran in 1980-1988) was held in Tehran on Thu. concurrent with the martyrdom anniversary of Hazrat Fatemeh (SA).', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 08:16:49 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:24'),
(4205158, 'mehr', '2,000 terrorists killed in Syria amid Russia military coop.', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225255/2-000-terrorists-killed-in-Syria-amid-Russia-military-coop', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – Syrian sources say around 2,000 foreign-backed Takfiri terrorists have been killed in northern Syria over the past week in joint strikes carried out by the Syrian military and its Russian allies.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 08:00:45 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:26'),
(4205159, 'mehr', 'Iran urges for intensified efforts against terrorism in Syria', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225254/Iran-urges-for-intensified-efforts-against-terrorism-in-Syria', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – Iran\'s Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi has warned resurgence of terrorism in Syria and its spread in region will pose a serious threat to peace and security in region, urging efforts by key regional players to counter threat.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 07:23:41 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:28'),
(4205160, 'mehr', 'Iranians mark martyrdom anniversary of Hazrat Fatemeh (PBUH)', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225253/Iranians-mark-martyrdom-anniversary-of-Hazrat-Fatemeh-PBUH', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – Iranians across the country and Shia Muslims throughout the world mourn on the martyrdom anniversary of Hazrat Fatemeh Zahra (PBUH), the noble daughter of Holy Prophet of Islam Hazrat Muhammad (S) on Thursday.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 06:03:12 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:29'),
(4205161, 'mehr', 'Amnesty International says Israel committing genocide in Gaza', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225252/Amnesty-International-says-Israel-committing-genocide-in-Gaza', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – There is “unequivocal” evidence Israel is committing genocidal acts with a “clear intent to destroy Palestinians”, according to Amnesty International.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 05:38:38 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:31'),
(4205162, 'mehr', 'Powerful earthquake strikes Iran\'s Khuzestan', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225251/Powerful-earthquake-strikes-Iran-s-Khuzestan', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – A 5.6 magnitude earthquake struck the southeastern Iranian province of Khuzestan on Thursday morning.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 05:26:17 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:33'),
(4205163, 'mehr', 'Muslims mark martyrdom anniv. of Hazrat Zahra (SA)', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225213/Muslims-mark-martyrdom-anniv-of-Hazrat-Zahra-SA', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 05 (MNA) – The martyrdom anniversary of Hazrat Fatemeh Zahra (SA), the revered daughter of the Holy Prophet Muhammad (S), is observed byIranians and Shia Muslims worldwide.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 04:30:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-05 10:33:35'),
