(4205222, 'wstreet', 'Oil Surplus, Spare Capacity to Pressure Prices in 2025', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/oil-edges-higher-markets-eye-opec-meeting-8b26be90?mod=rss_markets_main', 'Oil was stronger, but a global surplus and ample spare capacity will likely put pressure on prices next year despite potential OPEC+ output hike delays and improved compliance levels from member states, MUFG said, projecting Brent crude to average $73 a barrel.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 06:37:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-05 12:02:11'),
(4205223, 'wstreet', 'Campbell\'s New Chief Inherits Strengthened Business, but Big Challenges Loom', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/campbells-new-chief-inherits-strengthened-business-but-big-challenges-loom-d0dce5b4?mod=rss_markets_main', 'The entire food industry now faces a difficult environment with several pitfalls ahead, many of them potentially emanating from the Trump administration.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 06:30:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-05 12:02:13'),
