(4205975, 'nyt', 'Roommate Convicted in Murder of Kenyan Gay Rights Activist', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/05/world/africa/kenya-edwin-chiloba-murder.html', 'Edwin Chiloba’s body was found stuffed inside a metal box by the roadside last year. A high court judge did not give a motive but said his roommate carried out the murder.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 18:22:32 +0000', 0, '2024-12-05 21:09:38'),
