(4206253, 'nyt', 'Coming for Selfies, Staying for Art: Dakar’s Biennale Draws Young Crowd', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/05/world/africa/dakar-biennale-youth-audience.html', 'Encouraged by Senegal’s new president, teenagers and young adults, with social media tools in hand, have thronged an art exhibition that is usually the exclusive realm of the wealthy and elite.', 'Thu, 05 Dec 2024 14:40:22 +0000', 0, '2024-12-06 03:11:07'),
