(4206551, 'nyt', 'Shalom Nagar Dies; Reluctant Executioner of Adolf Eichmann', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/05/world/middleeast/shalom-nagar-dead.html', 'He was the hangman chosen to carry out the sentence on the fugitive Nazi war criminal, in Israel’s only case of capital punishment.', 'Fri, 06 Dec 2024 07:57:05 +0000', 0, '2024-12-06 09:12:10'),
