(4206786, 'nyt', 'Arsonists Set Fire to Melbourne Synagogue', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/australia/synagogue-fire-melbourne.html', 'Witnesses saw two people pouring accelerant in the synagogue early Friday, the police said. Australia’s prime minister condemned the attack as antisemitism.', 'Fri, 06 Dec 2024 11:15:15 +0000', 0, '2024-12-06 12:12:34'),
