(4207825, 'nyt', 'Iran Accelerates Production of Near-Bomb-Grade Uranium, IAEA Says', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/us/politics/iran-nuclear-fuel.html', 'The United Nations chief inspector says production has quadrupled. But it is not clear whether Iran is trying to touch off a crisis or gather bargaining chips for negotiations with the United States.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 02:53:22 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 03:10:46'),
