(4207892, 'kommersant', 'NBC: Трамп позвонил Байдену на прошлой неделе и поздравил с Днем благодарения', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361791', 'Президент США Джо Байден и избранный президент Дональд Трамп созванивались на прошлой неделе, сообщили источники NBC News. Утверждается, что инициатором звонка был республиканец.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 07:56:25 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 06:04:33'),
(4207893, 'kommersant', 'США предупредили американцев в Сирии о риске чрезвычайных ситуаций', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361787', 'Госдепартамент США призвал американцев покинуть Сирию коммерческими рейсами, пока они доступны. Посольство США в Дамаске не работает с 2012 года, интересы американцев защищает дипмиссия Чехии.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 06:50:42 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 06:04:35'),
(4207894, 'nyt', 'Live Updates: South Korea’s President Apologizes, but Doesn’t Resign Ahead of Impeachment Vote', 'https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/12/06/world/south-korea-president-yoon-impeachment', 'President Yoon Suk Yeol said he would not seek to impose martial law again. Large protests, including one supporting Mr. Yoon, began in Seoul ahead of the vote on Saturday.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 06:08:07 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:10:42'),
(4207895, 'nyt', 'Iran Begins to Evacuate Military Officials and Personnel From Syria', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/middleeast/iran-syria-evacuation.html', 'The withdrawals by one of President Bashar al-Assad’s key backers come amid a resurgent rebel offensive.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 04:02:07 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:10:44'),
(4207896, 'nyt', 'Athens Revives Hadrian’s Aqueduct to Help With Water Crunch', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/europe/greece-athens-hadrians-aqueduct-water.html', 'Hadrian’s Aqueduct supplied water to Greece’s capital for centuries but was then largely abandoned. It’s being revived to ease water scarcity amid global warming.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 05:01:11 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:10:46'),
(4207897, 'nyt', 'Opposition Grows to South Korea’s President as He Faces Impeachment', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/05/world/asia/south-korea-yoon-impeachment.html', 'The leader of President Yoon Suk Yeol’s own party has backed impeachment, on which the National Assembly is set to vote on Saturday.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 03:29:40 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:10:48'),
(4207898, 'nyt', 'What to Know About Ghana’s Election', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/africa/ghana-election-ndc-npp.html', 'Ghanaians voting on Saturday are confronted with a choice familiar to Americans: Return a one-term former president to office, or promote the vice president, at a time when anger over the economy is widespread.', 'Fri, 06 Dec 2024 19:56:50 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:10:59'),
(4207899, 'nyt', 'As India-Bangladesh Tensions Rise, So Do Fears of Tit-for-Tat Violence', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/asia/india-bangladesh-tensions.html', 'A diplomatic dispute over claims of persecution of Bangladeshi Hindus threatens to upend Bangladesh’s interim government.', 'Fri, 06 Dec 2024 17:54:38 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:11:03'),
(4207900, 'nyt', 'Read President Yoon’s Speech Apologizing for Declaring Martial Law in South Korea', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/asia/south-korea-president-yoon-speech.html', 'President Yoon Suk Yeol said his declaration of martial law was born out of “desperation,” and apologized for causing “anxiety.”', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 05:14:39 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:11:05'),
(4207901, 'nyt', 'Romanian Court Annuls Presidential Election', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/europe/romania-election-court.html', 'The decision came days after the government asserted that there had been “cyberattacks” meant to undermine the vote and security council documents indicated possible Russian meddling.', 'Fri, 06 Dec 2024 22:32:17 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:11:11'),
(4207902, 'nyt', 'UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer Is Fighting Populism From the Lonely Center Ground', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/europe/uk-starmer-populism-labour-farage.html', 'One of the last centrist leaders left on the global stage, Prime Minister Keir Starmer this week outlined his plan to deliver change for people in the U.K. Will it be enough?', 'Fri, 06 Dec 2024 14:44:48 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:11:33'),
(4207903, 'nyt', 'Notre-Dame Cathedral in Paris Reopens After 2019 Fire: What to Know', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/europe/notre-dame-cathedral-paris-opening.html', 'Millions of visitors will flock to the Parisian cathedral after it reopens in December for the first time since a destructive fire in 2019.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 03:22:23 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:11:37'),
(4207904, 'jazeera', '‘Hindus have changed’: A sleepy Indian state becomes anti-Muslim tinderbox', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2024/12/7/hindus-have-changed-a-sleepy-indian-state-becomes-anti-muslim-tinderbox?traffic_source=rss', 'The northeastern state of Tripura does not have a history of inter-religious clashes. That&#039;s changing under Modi&#039;s BJP.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 05:34:47 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:13:10'),
(4207905, 'un', 'Международный день гражданской авиации: крылья прогресса', 'https://news.un.org/feed/view/ru/story/2024/12/1459071', 'В субботу, 7 декабря, исполнилось 80 лет со дня подписания Конвенции о международной гражданской авиации. На протяжении восьми десятилетий это основополагающее международное соглашение служило основой для развития глобальной системы гражданской авиации.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:14:47'),
(4207906, 'rt_en', 'The Big Fat Indian Wedding: How $71 billion celebrations power the economy', 'https://www.rt.com/india/608753-wedding-business-india-billions/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Splurging on marriage ceremonies is deep-rooted in Indian culture, with families spending beyond their means to emulate celebrities Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 06:09:37 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:15:07'),
(4207907, 'rt_en', 'Russian e-commerce giant to import workers from India – media', 'https://www.rt.com/india/608869-russia-india-workers-e-commerce-ozon/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Russian e-commerce giant set to import workers from India as Moscow and New Delhi plan to train Indian workforce tailored to Russian needs Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 03:41:43 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 06:15:10'),
(4207908, 'rambler', 'Пушков назвал госпереворотом аннулирование результатов выборов в Румынии', 'https://news.rambler.ru/politics/53871272-pushkov-nazval-gosperevorotom-annulirovanie-rezultatov-vyborov-v-rumynii/', 'Аннулирование результатов первого тура президентских выборов в Румынии является госпереворотом. Об этом заявил председатель комиссии Совета Федерации по информационной политике и взаимодействию со СМИ Алексей Пушков.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 08:24:12 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 06:21:52'),
