(4208504, 'rt', 'Лавров заявил об отсутствии интереса к словам Зеленского', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1406109-lavrov-interes-zelenskii?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Министр иностранных дел России Сергей Лавров заявил об отсутствии интереса к словам Владимира Зеленского. Читать далее\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:15:06 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:14'),
(4208505, 'rt', 'Лавров проводит встречу с посланником Генсека ООН по Сирии', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1406107-lavrov-oon-vstrecha?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Глава МИД России Сергей Лавров встречается со специальным посланником Генерального секретаря ООН по Сирии Гейром Педерсеном. Читать далее\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:12:20 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:16'),
(4208506, 'rt', '«Уничтожено до 45 боевиков»: «Солнцепёк» поразил в ДНР пункт временной дислокации ВСУ', 'https://russian.rt.com/ussr/article/1406051-solncepyok-udar-vsu-dnr?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Расчёт российской тяжёлой огнемётной системы ТОС-1А «Солнцепёк» поразил пункт временной дислокации ВСУ в районе населённого пункта Разлив Волновахского района ДНР. По данным Минобороны РФ, в результате удара было ликвидировано до 45 украинских военнослужащих. Наряду с этим в приграничном районе Курской области барражирующим боеприпасом «Ланцет» был уничтожен танк Т-64 украинских вооружённых формирований. Читать далее\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:12:06 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:18'),
(4208507, 'rt', 'Дегтярёв заявил, что не осуждает выступающих под нейтральным статусом спортсменов', 'https://russian.rt.com/sport/news/1406106-degtyaryov-neitralnyi-status?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Министр спорта РФ Михаил Дегтярёв высказался о спортсменах, которые выступают в нейтральном статусе. Читать далее\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:06:21 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:20'),
(4208508, 'rt', 'Эрдоган заявил об отсутствии территориальных претензий к Сирии', 'https://russian.rt.com/world/news/1406104-erdogan-pretenzii-siriya?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Президент Турции Реджеп Тайип Эрдоган заявил об отсутствии территориальных претензий к Сирии. Читать далее\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:03:24 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:22'),
(4208509, 'rt', 'В Эрмитаже выстроились очереди для бесплатного посещения музея', 'https://russian.rt.com/nopolitics/news/1406105-ermitazh-muzei-ochered?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Очередь выстроилась во внутреннем дворе Государственного Эрмитажа для бесплатного посещения музея. Читать далее\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:00:17 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:23'),
(4208510, 'wallsj', 'Notre Dame Cathedral Is Reborn in a Darkened World', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/notre-dame-reopens-france-39cca1b8', 'A host of global figures, including President-elect Donald Trump, are scheduled to pay homage to the church in a reopening ceremony.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 12:46:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:36'),
(4208511, 'wallsj', '\'Come Back!\': A Surprise Boycott Saves South Korea\'s President from Impeachment', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/south-korea-impeachment-vote-president-yoon-suk-yeol-6f96063e', 'Opposition lawmakers vowed to keep trying to oust Yoon Suk Yeol for declaring martial law.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 11:55:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:38'),
(4208512, 'wallsj', 'Pressure Mounts on Syria\'s Assad as Rebels Threaten Damascus From South and North', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/pressure-mounts-on-syrias-assad-as-rebels-threaten-damascus-from-south-and-north-e436c821', 'Rebel gains have left foreign powers scrambling to secure their interests while President Bashar al-Assad faces his most precarious position in more than a decade of civil war.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 09:59:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-07 18:01:39'),
(4208513, 'wstreet', 'Why Few Bond Funds Are Passively Managed---and How to Create Your Own', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/bond-funds-fixed-income-index-self-management-9ab96aed?mod=rss_markets_main', 'The main fixed-income index is an easy benchmark for managers to beat and allows them to charge more for doing so. Solution: Do it yourself.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 10:00:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-07 18:02:13'),
(4208514, 'kommersant', 'Армия Сирии заявила об укреплении линии обороны вокруг Дамаска', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361968', 'Вооруженные силы Сирии заявили, что укрепили все свои оборонные позиции в пригороде Дамаска и к югу от столицы. Согласно сообщению главного командования, армия Сирии также продолжает наносить удары по группам террористов в провинциях Хама, Хомс и Деръа.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 20:49:30 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:02:49'),
(4208515, 'kommersant', 'Каир опроверг публикацию WSJ о призыве Египта к Асаду покинуть Сирию', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361964', 'Министерство иностранных дел Египта опровергло публикацию газеты The Wall Street Journal (WSJ), согласно которой Каир рекомендовал президенту Сирии Башару Асаду покинуть страну и сформировать новое правительство за ее пределами. «Арабская Республика Египет категорически опровергает сообщение The Wall Street Journal о том, что египетские официальные лица призывали президента Сирии покинуть страну и сформировать правительство в изгнании»,-- сказано в заявлении египетского МИДа (цитата по ТАСС).', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 20:18:33 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:02:51'),
(4208516, 'kommersant', 'Трамп встретился с Макроном в Париже', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361958', 'Избранный президент США Дональд Трамп прибыл в Париж, где встретился с президентом Франции Эмманюэлем Макроном в Елисейском дворце, передает BFMTV. В Париже господин Трамп планирует принять участие в церемонии открытия собора Парижской Богоматери после реставрации.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 19:49:43 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:02:53'),
(4208517, 'kommersant', 'Трамп заявил, что США не должны вмешиваться в конфликт в Сирии', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361951', 'США не должны иметь никакого отношения к ситуации в Сирии, сказал избранный президент Дональд Трамп. Он призвал не вмешиваться в конфликт так как Сирия им «не друг».', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 19:04:31 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:02:54'),
(4208518, 'kommersant', 'Лавров: западные эксперты пытаются рассчитать радиус поражения «Орешника»', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361947', 'Министр иностранных дел России Сергей Лавров заявил, что как российские, так и западные эксперты изучают, какие военные объекты стран Запада и НАТО могут попасть в зону поражения ракетной системы «Орешник», если ее разместят в Белоруссии. В ходе пресс-конференции по итогам визита Сергея Лаврова в Доху журналисты поделились с ним оценками эксперта, согласно которым при размещении «Орешника» в Белоруссии вся территория Европы и военные базы НАТО на Ближнем Востоке окажутся в радиусе поражения системы.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:40:44 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:02:56'),
(4208519, 'kommersant', 'Лавров прокомментировал сообщения об отходе кораблей РФ с базы в Тартусе', 'https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/7361944', 'Российские корабли не покидали базу в Тартусе в связи с ситуацией в Сирии, заявил министр иностранных дел России Сергей Лавров. Он рассказал в ходе Дохийского форума, что корабли участвуют в учениях в Средиземном море.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:17:40 +0300', 0, '2024-12-07 18:02:58'),
(4208520, 'nyt', 'Syria Live Updates: Government Forces Withdraw From Damascus Suburbs, Monitors Say', 'https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/12/07/world/syria', 'Two war monitoring groups said Syria’s military had pulled out of a number of Damascus suburbs where anti-government protests erupted. The movements could not immediately be confirmed.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:42:10 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:07:46'),
(4208521, 'nyt', 'Live Updates: France Unveils a Renovated Notre-Dame, 5 Years After a Ruinous Fire', 'https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/12/07/world/notre-dame-reopen', 'World leaders packed the 12th-century Gothic cathedral for a ceremony marking its monumental reconstruction. It opens to the public on Sunday.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:06:16 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:07:48'),
(4208522, 'nyt', 'Syria’s Government Battles Multiple Rebel Uprisings', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/middleeast/syria-assad-homs-damascus-rebels.html', 'The longtime Syrian dictator Bashar al-Assad is facing threats from rebellions on numerous fronts as his key ally, Iran, is paring back support.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:29:47 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:07:50'),
(4208523, 'nyt', 'Opposition Grows to South Korea’s President as He Faces Impeachment', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/05/world/asia/south-korea-yoon-impeachment.html', 'The leader of President Yoon Suk Yeol’s own party has backed impeachment, on which the National Assembly is set to vote on Saturday.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:37:49 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:07:55'),
(4208524, 'nyt', 'South Korea’s President Survives Impeachment Bid', 'https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/12/06/world/south-korea-president-yoon-impeachment', 'Opposition lawmakers failed to impeach President Yoon Suk Yeol over the political crisis he sparked by declaring martial law earlier this week. Tens of thousands of protesters had gathered.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:03:08 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:02'),
(4208525, 'nyt', 'How Notre-Dame Was Reborn', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/europe/notre-dame-paris-france.html', 'It took about 250 companies, 2,000 workers, about $900 million, a tight deadline and a lot of national pride.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:43:37 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:05'),
(4208526, 'nyt', 'Zelensky Meets Trump in Paris to Press Ukraine’s Case', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/europe/zelensky-trump-macron-notre-dame.html', 'The Ukrainian leader planned to use the grand reopening of Notre-Dame Cathedral to lobby the president-elect and other world leaders attending the ceremony.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:25:01 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:09'),
(4208527, 'nyt', 'South Korean President Yoon Survives Impeachment Vote After Martial Law', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/asia/south-korea-yoon-impeach.html', 'The country was thrown into deeper uncertainty after the governing party changed its stance and refused to oust him. Protesters vowed to keep the pressure on.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:08:16 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:10'),
(4208528, 'nyt', 'South Korean Leader’s Deal to Avoid Impeachment Signals Bigger Turmoil Ahead', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/asia/south-korea-yoon-impeachment-analysis.html', 'President Yoon Suk Yeol survived an opposition-led attempt to remove him by getting his party members to back him. But his troubles could now become theirs too.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:01:01 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:12'),
(4208529, 'nyt', 'Notre-Dame Reopening Ceremony Attendees Include Trump, Prince William and More Officials', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/europe/notre-dame-guests-trump-prince-william.html', 'Dozens of officials have been invited to Paris as the rebuilt cathedral welcomes visitors five years after a devastating fire.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:58:44 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:14'),
(4208530, 'nyt', 'Notre-Dame Cathedral in Paris Reopens: Photos', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/europe/notre-dame-reopening-photos.html', 'As Notre-Dame reopens after a 2019 fire, here is a selection of scenes from the famous Paris cathedral during a weekend of preparations and ceremonies.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:52:23 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:16'),
(4208531, 'nyt', 'Notre-Dame Cathedral Reopening Ceremony: How to Watch and Schedule ', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/europe/notre-dame-cathedral-reopen-watch-schedule.html', 'A speech by President Emmanuel Macron and a religious service will precede the broadcast of a taped concert by French and international musical artists.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:49:45 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:18'),
(4208532, 'nyt', 'Trump to Attend Notre-Dame Cathedral Reopening and Meet With Macron', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/europe/trump-paris-france-notre-dame-macron.html', 'The president-elect will be at the cathedral alongside dozens of world leaders. He was also meeting with President Emmanuel Macron of France, with whom he has had a rocky relationship.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 18:00:42 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:19'),
(4208533, 'nyt', 'Syria Civil War: What to Know About the Conflict and the Rebel Groups ', 'https://www.nytimes.com/article/syria-civil-war-rebels.html', 'Advances by a coalition of opposition groups have abruptly changed the landscape of Syria’s civil war after a long stalemate. Here’s a closer look at where things stand.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 16:27:30 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:21'),
(4208534, 'nyt', 'In Congo, a Medical Mystery Offers Clues to the Mpox Epidemic', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/health/mpox-virus-congo.html', 'In a remote Congolese town, a medical mystery led to the discovery of alarming changes in the mpox virus and, eventually, to a global health emergency.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 16:35:45 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:26'),
(4208535, 'nyt', 'On These Apps, the Dark Promise of Mothers Sexually Abusing Children', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/us/child-abuse-apple-google-apps.html', 'Smartphone apps downloaded from Apple and Google can allow parents and other abusers to connect with pedophiles who pay to watch — and direct — criminal behavior.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 16:40:25 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:08:28'),
(4208536, 'nyt', 'Notre-Dame Cathedral in Paris Reopens After 2019 Fire: What to Know', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/06/world/europe/notre-dame-cathedral-paris-opening.html', 'Millions of visitors will flock to the Parisian cathedral after it reopens in December for the first time since a destructive fire in 2019.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:55:39 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:04'),
(4208537, 'jazeera', 'Qatar says ‘momentum’ building back up in Gaza ceasefire efforts', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/7/qatari-pm-says-momentum-building-back-up-in-gaza-ceasefire-efforts?traffic_source=rss', 'Qatar&#039;s top diplomat says his country is &#039;engaging&#039; over past weeks in renewed push to end Israel&#039;s Gaza war.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:23:27 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:29'),
(4208538, 'jazeera', '‘Not our fight’: President-elect Trump distances US from Syria’s conflict', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/7/not-our-fight-president-elect-trump-distances-us-from-syrias-conflict?traffic_source=rss', 'In a morning social media post, Republican Donald Trump indicated the US should have &#039;nothing to do&#039; with Syria&#039;s war.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:07:15 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:31'),
(4208539, 'jazeera', 'Germany’s far-right AfD picks chancellor candidate first time', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/7/germanys-far-right-afd-picks-chancellor-candidate-first-time?traffic_source=rss', 'Alice Weidel&#039;s nomination comes before snap elections expected in February next year.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 16:20:45 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:33'),
(4208540, 'jazeera', 'Syria war to have ‘massive’ effect on Lebanon: US envoy Hochstein', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/7/syria-war-to-have-massive-impact-on-lebanon-says-us-envoy-hochstein?traffic_source=rss', 'The US diplomat said a weakened Syrian government will make it difficult for Iran to transfer weapons to Hezbollah.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 16:07:09 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:35'),
(4208541, 'jazeera', 'Syrian opposition reach Damascus countryside in rapid advance', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/program/newsfeed/2024/12/7/syrian-opposition-reach-damascus-countryside-in-rapid-advance?traffic_source=rss', 'Syrian opposition forces have reached the countryside around Damascus in a rapid advance.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:38:56 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:36'),
(4208542, 'jazeera', 'A year into Javier Milei’s presidency, Argentina’s poverty hits a new high', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/longform/2024/12/7/a-year-into-javier-mileis-presidency-argentinas-poverty-hits-a-new-high?traffic_source=rss', 'In Argentina, the poverty rate has surpassed 50 percent in the wake of wide-ranging austerity measures and deregulation.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:22:49 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:38'),
(4208543, 'jazeera', 'Russia, Turkiye, Iran want ‘immediate end’ to fighting in Syria: Lavrov', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/12/7/lavrov-says-russia-wants-immediate-end-to-fighting-in-syria?traffic_source=rss', 'Russian foreign minister says Moscow will do &#039;everything not to allow terrorists to prevail&#039; as Syrian rebels advance.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:12:25 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:40');
INSERT INTO `mynews` (`id`, `agency`, `head`, `link`, `text`, `pubdate`, `garbage`, `time_new`) VALUES
(4208544, 'jazeera', 'South Korean president’s party blocks impeachment vote', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/program/newsfeed/2024/12/7/south-korean-presidents-party-blocks-impeachment-vote?traffic_source=rss', 'South Korean President Yoon Suk Yeol’s People Power Party staged a walkout in parliament, blocking an impeachment vote.', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 14:56:04 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:09:42'),
(4208545, 'rt_en', 'Terrorists seize ancient Syrian city — media', 'https://www.rt.com/news/608897-fsa-take-palmyra-syria/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n US-backed militants have taken control of Palmyra, Turkish media reported on Saturday Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 17:39:10 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:10:24'),
(4208546, 'rt_en', 'Jihadists reach Damascus suburbs – AP', 'https://www.rt.com/news/608894-terrorists-reach-damascus-assad/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Terrorist groups have already seized some of Syria’s largest cities as Assad’s office claims the president is still in the capital Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 16:09:33 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:10:26'),
(4208547, 'rt_en', 'France is a perfect example of centrist elites wrecking the West', 'https://www.rt.com/news/608887-france-macron-centrism-crisis/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Political crises seem to be taking down Western nations one by one, their leaders clinging to hubris and showing a disdain for democracy Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 16:01:45 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:10:28'),
(4208548, 'rt_en', 'More F-16s delivered to Ukraine – Kiev', 'https://www.rt.com/news/608893-danish-fighter-jets-ukraine/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n A second batch of F-16 fighter jets has arrived to strengthen the country’s air defenses, Vladimir Zelensky has said Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:49:02 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:10:30'),
(4208549, 'rt_en', 'Biden and Trump hold phone call – media', 'https://www.rt.com/news/608895-biden-trump-phone-call/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Biden and Trump reportedly had their first direct communication since the president-elect’s White House visit in November Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Sat, 07 Dec 2024 15:43:56 +0000', 0, '2024-12-07 18:10:31'),
