(4208771, 'nyt', 'South Korean President Yoon Survives Impeachment Vote After Martial Law', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/asia/south-korea-yoon-impeach.html', 'The country was thrown into deeper uncertainty after the governing party changed its stance and refused to oust him. Protesters vowed to keep the pressure on.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 01:32:42 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 03:06:30'),
