(4209545, 'nyt', 'With Assad’s Fall, Iran’s ‘Axis of Resistance’ Unravels', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/08/world/middleeast/irans-syria-axis-of-resistance.html', 'Tehran’s main regional allies are weakened or collapsing: Syria’s president, Bashar al-Assad, has fled his country, Hezbollah is battered by conflict with Israel, and Hamas is still at war.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 17:46:19 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:14'),
(4209546, 'nyt', 'Syrians Mourn All They Have Lost, Even as They Celebrate', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/08/world/middleeast/syria-damascus-eyewitness-assad.html', 'Thoughts of loved ones dead or missing complicate joyous relief at the prospect of Bashar al-Assad’s losing power.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 15:47:29 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:25'),
(4209547, 'nyt', 'Notre-Dame Cathedral in Paris Reopens: Photos', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/07/world/europe/notre-dame-reopening-photos.html', 'As Notre-Dame reopens after a 2019 fire, here is a selection of scenes from the famous Paris cathedral during a weekend of preparations and ceremonies.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 17:14:06 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:31'),
(4209548, 'nyt', 'Bashar al-Assad of Syria Falls to Rebels', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/08/world/middleeast/assad-syria.html', 'President Bashar al-Assad had kept opposition forces at bay for a decade with help from Russia and Iran. But rebels struck at a moment of weakness for those countries.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 18:05:15 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:32'),
(4209549, 'nyt', 'Bogged Down in Ukraine, Russia Pays a Price in Syria', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/08/world/europe/russia-syria-assad-putin.html', 'With the fall of President Bashar al-Assad of Syria, Vladimir V. Putin has suffered one of the biggest geopolitical setbacks of his quarter-century in power.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 18:00:28 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:34'),
(4209550, 'nyt', 'Nations and Leaders React to Toppling of Syria Regime', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/08/world/middleeast/syria-global-reactions-world-leaders.html', 'The U.N. special envoy called it a “watershed moment” on Sunday as world leaders reckoned with the news.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 18:04:42 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:36'),
(4209551, 'nyt', 'As Syrian Rebels Take Charge, Freeing Prisoners of Assad Is a Priority', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/08/world/middleeast/syria-prisons-sednaya-assad.html', 'Many people want to determine the fates of loved ones who disappeared into a notorious military prison that was a symbol of human rights abuses under the rule of President Bashar al-Assad.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 16:51:59 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:37'),
