(4209553, 'nyt', 'As Syrian Government Loses Control, the Skies Above Go Quiet', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/08/world/middleeast/syria-quiet-skies.html', 'For years, people lived in terror of airstrikes by Syrian and Russian planes that helped keep the country’s authoritarian leader in power.', 'Sun, 08 Dec 2024 16:16:55 +0000', 0, '2024-12-08 18:08:41'),
