(4210276, 'jazeera', 'All eyes on what Trump will “put on the table” for Ukraine', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/program/quotable/2024/12/9/all-eyes-on-what-trump-will-put-on-the-table-for-ukraine?traffic_source=rss', 'Pavel Felgenhauer on what Russia can expect from a Trump administration, while Ukraine pushes even harder for NATO. ', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 07:26:06 +0000', 0, '2024-12-09 09:08:58'),
