(4210285, 'rt_en', '‘I don’t want to be breaking up families’ – Trump on immigration', 'https://www.rt.com/news/609030-trump-immigration-crack-down/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Incoming US President Donald Trump says he plans to end birthright citizenship and deport families with mixed immigration status Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 08:42:22 +0000', 0, '2024-12-09 09:09:43'),
