(4210288, 'rt_en', 'From Buyer to Supplier: India’s military industrial complex is on the rise', 'https://www.rt.com/india/608980-from-buyer-to-supplier-india-defence-manufacturing/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n A new defense industrial corridor is being bolstered by Modi’s call for ‘Atmanirbharta’ (self-reliance), a national goal since independence Read Full Article at RT.com\n', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 07:18:46 +0000', 0, '2024-12-09 09:09:48'),
