(4210518, 'nyt', 'Displaced Syrians Rush to Return Home', 'https://www.nytimes.com/2024/12/09/world/middleeast/syria-displaced.html', 'The 13-year conflict in Syria caused one of the “largest displacement crises in the world,” according to the United Nations. Now, an untold number are trying to go back.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 12:00:45 +0000', 0, '2024-12-09 12:07:54'),
