(4211219, 'mehr', 'Iran not to give in to pressures in nuclear field: VP', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225418/Iran-not-to-give-in-to-pressures-in-nuclear-field-VP', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Iran will negotiate and interact with Western countries about its nuclear program but will never give in to pressures, Iran’s Vice President Mohammad Reza Aref has said.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 15:51:31 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:41:50'),
(4211220, 'mehr', 'Iran, Iraq call for broadening judicial ties', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225419/Iran-Iraq-call-for-broadening-judicial-ties', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) –Senior judicial officials from Iran and Iraq have emphasized the need to strengthen judicial ties between the two countries.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 15:28:40 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:41:52'),
(4211221, 'mehr', 'Israeli regime military martyrs 50 more Palestinians in Gaza', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225421/Israeli-regime-military-martyrs-50-more-Palestinians-in-Gaza', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The Zionist regime’s army forces martyred 50 Palestinians and injured 84 others in the Gaza Strip over the past 24 hours, the Palestinian health ministry in the enclave said.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 15:11:23 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:41:54'),
(4211222, 'mehr', '7 crew members dead as S Korean fishing boat capsizes: report', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225416/7-crew-members-dead-as-S-Korean-fishing-boat-capsizes-report', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – At least seven crew members on board a fishing boat died after the vessel capsized following a collision in the waters off South Korea\'s southeastern coast on Monday.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 14:40:25 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:41:55'),
(4211223, 'mehr', 'Israeli forces confiscate towns in Syria’s Quneitra', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225409/Israeli-forces-confiscate-towns-in-Syria-s-Quneitra', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Israeli army forces have captured two towns in the southwestern Syrian province of Quneitra near the Israeli-occupied Golan Heights and are moving towards the neighboring Dara’a province.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 14:40:08 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:41:57'),
(4211224, 'mehr', 'Arab League condemns Israeli ‘illegal actions’ in Syria', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225405/Arab-League-condemns-Israeli-illegal-actions-in-Syria', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The Arab League has condemned Israel’s “illegal actions” in Syria, where the usurping regime is taking advantage of the chaotic situation to expand its occupation of the Arab country.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 14:39:22 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:41:59'),
(4211225, 'mehr', 'Haiti gang massacres at least 110 people in Cite Soleil', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225415/Haiti-gang-massacres-at-least-110-people-in-Cite-Soleil', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – At least 110 people were killed over the weekend in Haiti\'s Cite Soleil slum when a gang leader targeted elderly people he suspected of causing his child\'s illness through witchcraft.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 14:38:50 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:01'),
(4211226, 'mehr', 'Israel abusing turmoil in Syria to escalate Gaza genocide', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225417/Israel-abusing-turmoil-in-Syria-to-escalate-Gaza-genocide', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Iran’s Foreign Ministry Spokesman Esmail Baghaei stated that the Israeli regime is taking advantage of the complex situation in Syria to intensify its genocide in Gaza.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 14:30:16 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:03'),
(4211227, 'mehr', 'BRICS news digest for the previous week', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225422/BRICS-news-digest-for-the-previous-week', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The BRICS group of countries has had some new developments regarding technological achievements.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 14:10:50 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:05'),
(4211228, 'mehr', 'Why did former Syrian President Bashar Assad give up power?', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225420/Why-did-former-Syrian-President-Bashar-Assad-give-up-power', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Bashar al-Assad\'s government collapsed due to ignoring Iran\'s warnings about the growing threat of Idlib-based terrorists and his miscalculations as well as being coaxed by the empty promises about lifting of sanctions.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 13:33:47 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:06'),
(4211229, 'mehr', 'VIDEO: 2 Zionists killed in security incident near Jabalia', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225413/VIDEO-2-Zionists-killed-in-security-incident-near-Jabalia', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Zionist regime media reported a very severe security incident for its soldiers near Jabalia in the northern Gaza Strip, announcing the dispatch of several helicopters to transport the dead and injured in the incident.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 11:38:01 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:08'),
(4211230, 'mehr', '4 Israeli troopers killed in a tunnel blast in S Lebanon', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225414/4-Israeli-troopers-killed-in-a-tunnel-blast-in-S-Lebanon', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The Zionist regime’s military on Monday announced that four Israeli soldiers from 226th Brigade\'s 9263rd Battalion were killed when an underground compound collapsed during operational activity in southern Lebanon.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 11:36:51 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:10'),
(4211231, 'mehr', 'Decision to grant asylum to Bashar al-Assad made by Putin', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225412/Decision-to-grant-asylum-to-Bashar-al-Assad-made-by-Putin', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The decision to grant asylum to Bashar al-Assad and his family was made by Russian President Vladimir Putin, Kremlin spokesperson Dmitry Peskov said.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 11:16:28 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:11'),
(4211232, 'mehr', 'S. Korea says no disruption to US alliance', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225403/S-Korea-says-no-disruption-to-US-alliance', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – South Korean President is still commander in chief and there is no disruption to the US alliance, the defense ministry said after it was revealed Yoon was under criminal investigation for declaring martial law last week.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 11:03:42 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:13'),
(4211233, 'mehr', 'South Korea President Yoon banned from foreign travel', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225408/South-Korea-President-Yoon-banned-from-foreign-travel', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – South Korean President Yoon Suk Yeol has been banned from leaving the country over a failed attempt at imposing martial law, a justice ministry official said on Monday.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 11:00:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:15'),
(4211234, 'mehr', 'Parl. holds closed session with FM Araghchi in attendance', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/photo/225411/Parl-holds-closed-session-with-FM-Araghchi-in-attendance', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The Iranian Parliament held a closed session on Monday with the participation of Iranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghci with a focus on the recent developments in Syria.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 10:49:19 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:16'),
(4211235, 'mehr', 'Air pollution in Tabriz', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/photo/225410/Air-pollution-in-Tabriz', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) –With the approach of winter and the beginning of the phenomenon of temperature inversion, the Iranian city of Tabriz is witnessing air pollution these days.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 10:22:59 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:18'),
(4211236, 'mehr', 'Israeli warplanes conduct strikes across Syria', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225400/Israeli-warplanes-conduct-strikes-across-Syria', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The Israeli military carried out a series of airstrikes late Sunday across Syria targeting around 100 sites, according to reports.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 10:00:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:20'),
(4211237, 'mehr', 'Russia opposes NATO expansion to Southeast Asia: Diplomat', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225402/Russia-opposes-NATO-expansion-to-Southeast-Asia-Diplomat', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Russia opposes NATO expansion at the expense of Southeast Asian nations, Russian Deputy Foreign Minister Andrey Rudenko said, addressing the 15th Asian conference of the Valdai Discussion Club.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 09:43:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:21'),
(4211238, 'mehr', 'Iran football team runner-up at Asia-Pacific Deaf Games', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225397/Iran-football-team-runner-up-at-Asia-Pacific-Deaf-Games', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Iran’s football team finished in second place at the 10th Asia-Pacific Deaf Games held in Malaysia.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 09:30:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:23'),
(4211239, 'mehr', '1st day of 18th Iran Intl Documentary Film Festival in Tehran', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/photo/225406/1st-day-of-18th-Iran-Intl-Documentary-Film-Festival-in-Tehran', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The first day of the 18th Iran International Documentary Film Festival ‘Cinéma Vérité’ was held at Charsu Cineplex in Tehran on Sunday evening.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 09:18:11 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:25'),
(4211240, 'mehr', 'Astana process continuation depends on Iran, Turkey, Russia', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225404/Astana-process-continuation-depends-on-Iran-Turkey-Russia', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Iranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi says the continuation of the Astana process on Syria depends on the developments in the Arab country and the decisions of Iran, Russia, and Turkey.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 09:17:11 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:26'),
(4211241, 'mehr', 'Military helicopter crashes in southwest Turkey', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225407/Military-helicopter-crashes-in-southwest-Turkey', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – A military helicopter crashed during a training flight in southwest Turkey on Monday.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 09:15:45 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:28'),
(4211242, 'mehr', 'Russian air defense destroys 13 Ukrainian drones overnight', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225396/Russian-air-defense-destroys-13-Ukrainian-drones-overnight', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – Russian air defense systems destroyed 13 Ukrainian drones over the Belgorod, Rostov, and Astrakhan regions over the past night, the Russian Defense Ministry said on Monday.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 08:30:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:30'),
(4211243, 'mehr', 'Israeli forces carry out overnight aggression on Gaza Strip', 'https://en.mehrnews.com/news/225393/Israeli-forces-carry-out-overnight-aggression-on-Gaza-Strip', 'TEHRAN, Dec. 09 (MNA) – The Israeli occupation continues its genocidal war against the Gaza Strip for the 430th day, attacking different areas overnight on Monday, and demolishing residential areas of the territory.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 07:59:00 GMT', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:31'),
(4211244, 'kyodo', 'A-bomb survivor group rep. &quot;saddened&quot; by recent talk of using nukes', 'https://english.kyodonews.net/news/2024/12/eadeb5bafa58-a-bomb-survivors-group-to-hold-presser-before-nobel-prize-ceremony.html', 'OSLO - Terumi Tanaka, co-chair of Japan\'s leading group of atomic bomb survivors and winner of this year\'s ...', '2024-12-10 00:08:00', 0, '2024-12-09 19:42:36'),
