(4211299, 'rt', 'Губернатор Владимиров заявил о важности исполнения новогодних желаний детей', 'https://russian.rt.com/russia/news/1407016-gubernator-elka-zhelanii?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Губернатор Ставропольского края Владимир Владимиров заявил о важности исполнения новогодних желаний детей. Читать далее\n', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 22:58:04 +0300', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:32'),
(4211300, 'rt', 'Мостовой заявил, что «Краснодар» ничего не выиграет с тренером Мусаевым', 'https://russian.rt.com/sport/news/1407022-mostovoi-krasnodar-rpl?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Бывший футболист московского «Спартака» Александр Мостовой высказал мнение, что тренер Мурад Мусаев не сможет ничего выиграть с«Краснодаром». Читать далее\n', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 22:56:23 +0300', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:34'),
(4211301, 'rt', 'Кабмин утвердил, что сведения из реестра контролируемых лиц будут на сайте МВД', 'https://russian.rt.com/russia/news/1407023-kabmin-inostrancy-pravila?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Кабмин утвердил правила размещения в интернете сведений об иностранцах, которые будут содержаться в создаваемом реестре контролируемых лиц. Читать далее\n', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 22:53:03 +0300', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:36'),
(4211302, 'rt', 'Мусаев: Агкацев — это наш основной вратарь на долгие годы', 'https://russian.rt.com/sport/news/1407017-musaev-agkacev-krasnodar?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS', '\n Главный тренер «Краснодара» Мурад Мусаев высказался об игре голкипера Станислава Агкацева. Читать далее\n', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 22:37:07 +0300', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:38'),
(4211303, 'wallsj', 'What Happens Next in Syria', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/syria-civil-war-explained-731644f6', 'Rebel fighters seized Damascus and deposed Assad, thrusting Syria into an uncertain future.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 18:23:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:39'),
(4211304, 'wallsj', 'U.S. Renews Push to Find Missing American Austin Tice in Syria', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/u-s-renews-push-to-find-missing-american-austin-tice-in-syria-3fc48ba3', 'The collapse of Assad’s regime and the release of thousands of prisoners in the country are stoking new urgency around finding Tice, who disappeared 12 years ago.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 16:40:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:41'),
(4211305, 'wallsj', 'Canada Would Retaliate in Event of 25% U.S. Tariff, Trudeau Says', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/canadian-prime-minister-trudeau-says-ottawa-would-retaliate-in-event-of-25-u-s-tariff-1cdfa2ea', 'The prime minister said Ottawa would impose its own set of tariffs should President-elect Donald Trump follow through on his pledge.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 16:26:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:43'),
(4211306, 'wallsj', 'Israeli Strikes on Syria Target Chemical Weapons, Rocket and Missile Arsenals', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/israeli-airstrikes-target-syrian-chemical-weapons-systems-743f18a2', 'Israel has used the chaos in Syria as an opportunity to seize a buffer zone with Syria and destroy strategic assets, afraid they could end up in rebel hands.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 16:14:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:45'),
(4211307, 'wallsj', 'Haiti Gangs Kill More Than 180 Mostly Elderly People in Capital', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/haiti-gangs-kill-more-than-180-mostly-elderly-people-in-capital-a88d9e10', 'A warlord ordered the slaying of elderly slum residents he suspected of giving his son a severe illness through witchcraft, the U.N. and human-rights groups said.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 16:00:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:47'),
(4211308, 'wallsj', 'Syrians Search Notorious Prison for Thousands of Missing', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/syrians-search-notorious-prison-for-thousands-of-missing-fe6ac5fe', 'The regime’s downfall has given hope to families of Syrians who disappeared in recent decades.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 14:26:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:01:49'),
(4211309, 'wstreet', 'Nikkei May Rise as Hopes for China Stimulus Grow', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/australia-shares-on-track-for-a-flat-open-ad919d24?mod=rss_markets_main', 'Japanese stocks may rise as hopes for China’s policy stimulus grow and the yen weakens.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 18:43:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:02:16'),
(4211310, 'wstreet', 'The WSJ Dollar Index Flat at 100.40', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/yen-strengthens-amid-prospects-of-narrowing-rate-gap-between-u-s-japan-5cbfb6be?mod=rss_markets_main', 'The WSJ Dollar Index was up 0.02% to 100.40 — up for two consecutive trading days.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 17:40:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:02:18'),
(4211311, 'wstreet', 'U.S. Stocks Fall as China Probes Nvidia', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/nikkei-may-rise-as-hopes-for-fed-rate-cut-continue-ddca58c9?mod=rss_markets_main', 'U.S. stocks closed lower after China announced an antitrust probe into Nvidia. Nine of the 11 S&amp;P 500 sectors finished in the red.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 16:21:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:02:20'),
(4211312, 'wstreet', 'Gold Climbs to Start Week', 'https://www.wsj.com/articles/gold-edges-higher-amid-geopolitical-tensions-in-middle-east-44c30973?mod=rss_markets_main', 'Front-month gold futures settled up 1%, with geopolitical turmoil once again as the main catalyst for higher prices, this time coming out of Syria after Bashar al-Assad’s regime fell over the weekend.', 'Mon, 09 Dec 2024 15:20:00 -0500', 0, '2024-12-10 00:02:22'),
